Lei da Faixa de Fronteira (Lei 6.634/1979), Lei 9.469/1997 and Lei de Segurança do Tráfego Aquaviário (Lei 9.537/1997) verified 2026-10-31: replay of Planalto's annotated pages (l6634.htm 5 versions 1979-05-03 .. 2020-09-08; l9469.htm 8 versions 1997-07-11 .. 2015-12-26, against l9469compilado.htm; l9537.htm 3 versions 1998-06-10 .. 2024-01-16): 0 differences, 0 replay problems. In force: Lei 6.634 on publication (DOU 3.5.1979), Lei 9.469 on publication (DOU 11.7.1997), Lei 9.537 180 days after the DOU of 12.12.1997 (10.6.1998). Hand: Lei 14.004/2020 art. 1 (Lei 6.634 art. 4 caput, art. 8-A) vetoed and promulgated after the override, DOU 8.9.2020 (read on Lei 14.004's page); MP 2.216-37 and MP 2.226/2001 kept in force by EC 32 art. 2 (texts read); MP 449/2008 -> Lei 11.941/2009, MP 496/2010 -> Lei 12.348/2010; Lei 9.469 art. 6 parágrafo único -> § 1º (MP 2.226) kept under its old label to 5.9.2001. Open items: Vide ADIN 2.527-9 and Lei 14.057/2020 on Lei 9.469, the MP 1.561 chain before conversion, Lei 9.537's regulations. effects_fix.py: 0 moves. Checks: duplicate lines 0, dupcheck 0, note-leak 0, quotation check only art. 11 of Lei 6.634 (its own quoted amendment of DL 1.135), first-line 0, order 0, original-article 0, overlap 0 SAME, latecaput read (untouched children of rewritten capita), pubgap clean; parse twice identical (sha256 b6af9804; fabe98f0 after effects_fix); merged scratch build with every installed part: 145 acts, 2505 versions, 2008 commits, check.py 0 mismatches, 0 trailer errors, --compare identical, audit_push clean on main and futuro.
2026-10-31 (batch 18) re-verified under the Medida Provisória edition reader (each pre-EC 32 edition its own key, read on its own page, dated by its own DOU day and ended by the next edition): the editions this part's pages credit (2.216-37/2001) are each the edition pinned as that MP's reference page, so a fresh parse + effects_fix is byte-identical to the parse before the change (0 units moved); merged build with every installed part: 175 acts, 2978 versions, check.py 0 mismatches, 0 trailer errors, --compare identical, audit_push clean.
